    <!-- Guide -->
    <string name="setup_guide_title">Built-in ADB Setup Guide</string>
    <string name="setup_guide_content">1. Connect to any Wi-Fi network (a personal hotspot or offline router works fine).\n\n2. Go to Settings → About phone → tap \"Build number\" 7 times to enable Developer options.\n\n3. In Developer options, turn ON \"Wireless debugging\".\n\n4. Tap \"Pair device with pairing code\" inside Wireless debugging. Note the 6-digit code and port.\n\n5. In Quick Replacer, tap \"Pair\" and enter the port and 6-digit code (you can also use the floating prompt or notification so you don\'t close the pairing screen).\n\n6. Once paired, tap \"Connect\" (or let Auto-connect discover the port). Wireless debugging is paired permanently until turned off.</string>
